{"id":"8d06776406d2e58e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-rosser-system.md","title":"Rosser System in Smullyan’s Sense","display":"df-smullyan-rosser-system — Rosser System in Smullyan’s Sense","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-rosser-system"],"display":"df-smullyan-rosser-system — Rosser System in Smullyan’s Sense","source":"第 VI 章 pp. 77–80；第 VIII 章 p. 98（PDF 94–97、115）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-rosser-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-rosser-system — Rosser System in Smullyan’s Sense"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 77–80；第 VIII 章 p. 98（PDF 94–97、115）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"905868da4e6087cf\" href=\"?note=905868da4e6087cf\" title=\"92-df-separation-in-system\">92-df-separation-in-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k:\\mathbb N^k\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(\\tau_k:\\mathbb N^k\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为固定有效元组编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k[A]\">\\(\\tau_k[A]\\)</span> 是其码像；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 为外部 c.e. 谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\\)</span> 是无捕获数码实例操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSys}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSys}_G\\)</span> 是下文定义的固定元数与全元数系统性质；固定元数定义的使用域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\mathrm{CE}(\\tau_k[A])\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\tau_k[B])\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in A\\setminus B\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in B\\setminus A\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k(\\mathcal S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\mathrm{CE}(\\tau_k[A])\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\tau_k[B])\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in A\\setminus B\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in B\\setminus A\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k(\\mathcal S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 集合与关系；此处经固定有效编码译为 c.e.。按原书直接要求任意两个 c.e. 关系的差集相互分离，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 本身不交；重叠部分不受限制。定义没有把一致性塞进去，一致性在定理中单列。不一致系统也可满足这种单向分离条件。它与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" href=\"?note=d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" title=\"92-df-rosser-system\">92-df-rosser-system</a>中保留的外部 Rosser 可证码谓词类型完全不同。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 77–80；第 VIII 章 p. 98（PDF 94–97、115）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-separation-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"905868da4e6087cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","status":"resolved","id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书使用 $\\Sigma_1$ 集合与关系；此处经固定有效编码译为 c.e.。按原书直接要求任意两个 c.e. 关系的差集相互分离，不要求 $A,B$ 本身不交；重叠部分不受限制。定义没有把一致性塞进去，一致性在定理中单列。不一致系统也可满足这种单向分离条件。它与[[92-df-rosser-system]]中保留的外部 Rosser 可证码谓词类型完全不同。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k:\\mathbb N^k\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k[A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserSys}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl[&\n\\mathrm{CE}(\\tau_k[A])\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\tau_k[B])\\\\\n&\\Longrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in A\\setminus B\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in B\\setminus A\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^k(\\mathcal S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false}],"bytes":2305,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"文件名保留。它定义外部 $\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G$，不是原书 Rosser system。原书系统性质见[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]。界改为不大于证明码以对应原书的 $z\\le y$ 版本；对本库“一条证明序列有唯一末项”的编码，相同码不可能同时证明公式及其否定，因此严格与非严格界在此给相同外部谓词。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]] → [[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]；[[92-df-finite-order-system]] → [[92-lem-rosser-separation]]给出证明序的分离机制。Rosser 系统需分离 $A\\setminus B$ 与 $B\\setminus A$。"},{"id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"faf6841087a5303b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7745a6d434bbe885","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)$ 表示仅二元关系的 Rosser 性质，见[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]"}],"outgoing":["905868da4e6087cf","69a2a133da01f9c9","d03aab2a94232c0e","d8d7d3ba56a05b13"]}